     1,
     "Yes, just provide a showProgress function, this is the default:<div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:16px\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">this</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">.</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">showProgress</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">function</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">el</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">,</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">show</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">{</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\">      <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">var</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">RECALC_CLASS</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;recalculating&#39;</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\">      <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">if</span> <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">show</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">)</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\">        <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">$</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">el</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">).</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">addClass</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">RECALC_CLASS</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">);</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\">      <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-weight:bold\">else</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\">\r\n\r\n        <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">$</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">el</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">).</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">removeClass</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">(</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">RECALC_CLASS</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">);</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;border:0px\">    <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\">};</span><div><br></div></div></pre></div><div>So the &quot;show&quot; parameter is a boolean that indicates whether you should be showing or hiding the progress display.</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
